---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About - The AI BIAIS Initiative | AI BIAIS" description="Discover the genesis, mission, and commitments of the AI BIAIS initiative for fair and transparent artificial intelligence.">
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-ibi-night text-white">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="absolute top-1/3 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-20" style="background: radial-gradient(circle, #6B1EE8 0%, transparent 70%)"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 md:py-32">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-xs font-display font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-ibi-primary mb-6">ABOUT THE INITIATIVE</p>
        <h1 class="font-display font-extrabold text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-tight mb-6">
          A citizen response to <span class="text-gradient-ibi">global concerns</span> about AI
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-ibi-fg3 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          AI BIAIS INITIATIVE was born from a simple conviction: facing warnings from scientists, international institutions, and citizens, a structured, rigorous, and open response was needed.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- GENESE -->
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-display font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-ibi-primary mb-3">GENESIS</p>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-6">Why this initiative</h2>
        <p class="text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          For several years, leaders of major AI laboratories, researchers, the Pope, NGOs, and international institutions like UNESCO, the OECD, and the UN have been warning about the dangers of current developments in artificial intelligence.
        </p>
        <p class="text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          These warnings are legitimate and converging. But they often remain at the stage of observation, without offering concrete, citable, and open tools for action.
        </p>
        <p class="text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">
          AI BIAIS INITIATIVE aims to fill this void by proposing a common reference framework for AI biases: 250 documented biases, 68 global Regulations, 21 analytical views. All accessible via an open, citable, and sustainable REST API.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🌍</div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-2">A global reach</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">AI biases have no borders. This initiative is designed to be used everywhere, by everyone, in all languages.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🔬</div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-2">Scientific rigor</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">Each bias is documented with its Sources, detection metrics, alert thresholds, and citable via DOI.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🤝</div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-2">Total openness</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">Data published under CC-BY 4.0 license. No barriers, no access conditions. Knowledge must circulate.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FOUNDER -->
  <section class="bg-ibi-arctic py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <p class="text-xs font-display font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-ibi-primary mb-3">FOUNDER</p>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-4">Led by an expert in the field</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-ibi-border p-8 md:p-12">
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-start">
          <div class="md:col-span-1">
            <img src="/mohamadou-sidibe.jpg" alt="Mohamadou SIDIBE - FOUNDER, AI BIAIS INITIATIVE" class="w-40 h-40 rounded-full object-cover mb-6 border-4 border-ibi-border shadow-lg" loading="lazy" />
            <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mb-2">Mohamadou SIDIBE</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 mb-4">Chief Data Officer · Expert en Governance des Données & IA</p>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm text-ibi-fg3">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-ibi-primary">🎓</span>
                <span>Polytechnique ExED</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-ibi-primary">✉️</span>
                <a href="mailto:contact@ai-biais-initiative.org" class="hover:text-ibi-primary">contact@ai-biais-initiative.org</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="md:col-span-2">
            <p class="text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              As a Chief Data Officer and expert in Data and AI Governance, I have seen on a daily basis how algorithmic biases constitute a major societal issue, and how much tools were lacking to document, classify, and process them rigorously.
            </p>
            <p class="text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              <strong class="text-ibi-fg">AI BIAIS INITIATIVE</strong> is the answer I wanted to provide: an open, structured, citable, and useful knowledge base, so that Researchers, policymakers, regulators, and developers can finally speak the same language about AI biases.
            </p>
            <p class="text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed mb-6">
              I also brought the <strong class="text-ibi-fg">Framework AEXIA</strong>, an integrated governance framework for explainable AI that articulates explainability, organizational maturity, and deployed system maturity.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
              <a href="/en/aexia" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-display font-semibold rounded-lg gradient-ibi text-white hover:opacity-90">Discover AEXIA</a>
              <a href="mailto:contact@ai-biais-initiative.org" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-display font-semibold rounded-lg border border-ibi-border text-ibi-fg2 hover:bg-ibi-arctic">Contact me</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- VISION -->
  <section class="bg-ibi-night text-white py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <p class="text-xs font-display font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-ibi-primary mb-3">VISION</p>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-6">A fair, explainable, responsible AI</h2>
        <p class="text-ibi-fg3 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          AI is not neutral. It reflects the choices, data, and social structures that produced it. Recognizing its biases is not an admission of weakness - it is the first step towards a truly trustworthy AI.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-ibi-marine rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">⚖️</div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-2">Equity</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg3 leading-relaxed">No AI system should produce systematic discrimination. Biases must be identified, measured, and corrected.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-ibi-marine rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🔍</div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-2">Explainability</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg3 leading-relaxed">A system that makes decisions about humans must be able to explain them. This is a democratic requirement, not just a technical one.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-ibi-marine rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🛡️</div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-2">Responsibility</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg3 leading-relaxed">Behind every algorithm, there are human choices. These choices must be traced, audited, and owned.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- VALUES -->
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
      <p class="text-xs font-display font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-ibi-primary mb-3">VALUES</p>
      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-4">Our commitments</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-2">🌐 Openness</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">All data is published under CC-BY 4.0 license. Everyone can view, cite, and reuse it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-2">🔬 Rigor</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">Each bias is backed by scientific Sources, detection metrics, and documented alert thresholds.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-2">🌍 Universality</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">AI biases have no borders. The database covers 68 global Regulations and 5 continents.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-2">🤝 Cooperation</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">The initiative is open to contributions: researchers, NGOs, institutions, citizens. Together, we go further.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA FINAL -->
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pb-24">
    <div class="gradient-ibi rounded-2xl p-12 text-center text-white">
      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-4">Join the movement</h2>
      <p class="text-white/90 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
        Researchers, policymakers, NGOs, institutions, citizens - this initiative is yours. Together, let's build a trustworthy AI.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        
        
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>